        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>高中化学 300 条常考知识盲点</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 550px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 28px 30px 12px 30px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 760px;\n  }\n  h1.main-title {\n    font-size: 52px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  h2.sub-title {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #d40000;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #d40000;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .content p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #d40000;\n    font-weight: 800;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"main-title\">高中化学</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"sub-title\">300 条常考知识盲点</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <p>1、<span class=\"red\">钝化现象：</span>铁、铝在冷的浓硝酸或浓硫酸中钝化。钝化只在常温下用，加热条件下铁会与浓硫酸反应。<br>\n    2Fe + 6H2SO4(浓)=Fe2(SO4)3+3SO2↑+ 6H2O 钝化是指活泼金属在强酸中氧化表面生成一层致密的氧化膜组织金属进一步反应。</p>\n\n    <p>2、<span class=\"red\">浓盐酸、浓硝酸</span>，在离子方程式中拆开，浓硫酸不拆开。</p>\n\n    <p>3、在离子方程式中，澄清石灰水要拆开写成离子，<span class=\"red\">浑浊石灰乳</span>不拆。</p>\n\n    <p>4、有<span class=\"red\">阴离子</span>必有<span class=\"red\">阳离子</span>，有<span class=\"red\">阳离子</span>未必有<span class=\"red\">阴离子</span>，如金属中只有自由电子。</p>\n\n    <p>5、氢氧化钠与乙醇不反应。</p>\n\n    <p>6、<span class=\"red\">阿伏伽德罗常数</span>考点陷阱有：未告知体积，如 PH＝1 的盐酸溶液中，氢离子的个数为 0.1NA。</p>\n\n    <p>7、苯中无 C=C 双键。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">第 1 页 共 59 页</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
